(
  <question ?>Who owns update/delete targeting for RuntimeMutation?</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>The domain runtime adapter, using compiled model primary-key facts.</?>
    <decision-text ?>Keep bundle handlers storage-neutral and derive the public Writer equality predicate inside the runtime from the entity primary key and mutation values.</?>
    <rationale ?>The runtime owns public Writer adaptation; exposing SQL or arbitrary predicates to bundles would duplicate storage authority and expand the API unnecessarily.</?>
    <evidence ?>G7 multi-row failure, public Writer where contract, SQLite unscoped mutation semantics, and fresh coding AttractorCheck PASS.</?>
  )
  >
)>
